e4_session_cookie_domain.s:
Make e4's session cookie shared across the beeeproject.com zone by setting Domain=.beeeproject.com via a COOKIE_DOMAIN env var, and route every session-cookie set/delete through it.

CONTEXT: e4 (e4.beeeproject.com) and beee (beeeproject.com) already share the exact same HMAC session format, the same SECRET value, the same Google OAuth client, and the same Qdrant cluster+collection 'i'. The ONLY thing stopping a cookie from being valid on both hosts is that e4 sets the 'session' cookie host-only (no Domain), so e4.beeeproject.com never sends it to beeeproject.com. Fix = set Domain='.beeeproject.com' on the session cookie so both hosts receive it.

Root cause file: src/lib/server/session.ts (e4) — encode_session/decode_session are fine and MUST stay byte-identical (they are the compat layer). The cookie options live inline at the call sites, so introduce one shared options object here.

