- calling it again with a different name returns the SAME id and does NOT change n (existing record wins);
- a legacy record seeded at id 'legacy' with {s:'u',m:'a@b.com',p:'<picture-url>'} is found by the m-fallback: find_or_create_user returns 'legacy' and backfills e:'a@b.com' via setPayload;
